  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "698acd29-311b-4eda-99ac-46a1887f032a",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### See All Colorsets\n",
    "\n",
    "You can also do `va.help.color(cvd_type='all')` to see how all VisualAstro colorsets degrade in each cvd space at once:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 15,
   "id": "9b5db7f6-de2a-44f2-9fdf-14d75e176e2a",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "image/png": "",
      "text/plain": [
       "<Figure size 800x6480 with 1 Axes>"
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "display_data"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "va.help.color(cvd_type='all')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "7cbeb8c0-e906-414f-8cd2-52c503fabad6",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Randomize Your Colorset"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "5cf40e7d-562a-48da-a3a0-51ce61d3094e",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Use a random colorset to keep your plots more exciting! Both methods of creating a random colorset will generate a new colorset each time they are called."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 16,
   "id": "22f02496-1e19-4d5c-940f-e1200799129f",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "image/png": "",
      "text/plain": [
       "<Figure size 800x100 with 1 Axes>"
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "display_data"
    },
    {
     "data": {
      "image/png": "",
      "text/plain": [
       "<Figure size 800x100 with 1 Axes>"
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "display_data"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "# get random colors! This will return N random colors each time you run the function!\n",
    "va.help.color(va.random_colors(10))\n",
    "\n",
    "# or use `get_colors`! The number of colors here is set by `va.config.random_colors_max_N`\n",
    "va.help.color(va.get_colors('random'))"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
