   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "df882b17-a213-4e84-a4ba-04badf3831bf",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "#### xkcd Colors"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 20,
   "id": "f9d27179-e8a2-4590-a044-5e8d481f19b3",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "All colors displayed here are recognizable by VisualAstro and Matplotlib under 'xkcd:color name'.\n",
      "\n",
      "Unless there is a color with the same name, VisualAstro will also recognize the colors if the \n",
      "'xkcd:' prefix is dropped. Colors are shown here with 'xkcd:' dropped whenever possible.\n",
      "\n",
      "Matplotlib does not recognize the colors if 'xkcd:' is dropped.\n"
     ]
    },
    {
     "data": {
      "image/png": "",
      "text/plain": [
       "<Figure size 872x5260 with 1 Axes>"
      ]
